      "content": "The feeling that nothing exists authentically beneath the surface is an incredibly heavy burden to carry alone. Please know that this exhaustion and the sense of inauthenticity are common signs of complex grief, not a reflection of who you truly are. Reaching out to a mental health professional can provide a space where you can be seen without having to pretend, and they can help you navigate through this void. You are not waiting to stop feeling this way; you are navigating a legitimate struggle that can eventually become manageable.",
